  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are mutually exclusive</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>26</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now taking intersection of all we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So maximum value&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and minimum value&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
